# 0.1.18 相对 0.1.17 的净变化；一条一行，格式「分类|语言|内容」
fixed|zh|修复升级包残片恰好收满后重试永远失败的问题：收满的残片直接转正，不再被服务器 416 卡死
fixed|en|Fixed resume attempts stuck forever when a fragment was already complete: full-size fragments are now promoted to the package instead of being rejected by the server (HTTP 416)
fixed|zh|修复弱网续传在服务器响应错位时可能拼出坏包的问题：校验响应起点，错位就整段重来
fixed|en|Fixed resume assembling a corrupt package when the server misaligns the response: the start offset is now validated and downloads restart from scratch on mismatch
fixed|zh|修复重复点击「下载并安装」会把已收的安装包整包重下的问题：成品在位直接复用
fixed|en|Repeated clicks no longer re-download an already fetched package; the existing file is reused
fixed|zh|修复下载中点「立即检查更新」会把下载进度显示顶掉的问题：下载期间该按钮禁用
fixed|en|The check-updates button is disabled during a download so the progress display can no longer be displaced
fixed|zh|修复繁体用户在启动自动检查失败时看到简体文案的问题：失败提示按界面语言出
fixed|en|Automatic update-check failures are now localized for Traditional-Chinese users
updated|zh|断点续传加身份核对：同版本重发布或内容变更时自动整段重来，不盲拼
updated|en|Resume now validates fragment identity via HTTP If-Range: same-version republish or content changes trigger a clean restart instead of blind appending
updated|zh|重复点击下载的拒绝提示改用独立错误码与准确文案，不再与「安装包已作废」混淆
updated|en|Duplicate-download rejections now use a dedicated code and clear copy, no longer conflated with "package discarded"
updated|zh|主界面标题栏在应用名后显示版本号
updated|en|The main window title bar now shows the version next to the app name
